From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tooktang <tooktang@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:05:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] api-key-pure-byok: isolate explicit models and auth errors

Pinned API-key mode keeps only explicit model catalog entries and does not use stale session credentials to produce OAuth/WebLogin recovery advice.

Gork-Patch-Id: api-key-pure-byok

Gork-Invariant: api-key-explicit-models-only

Gork-Risk: critical
---
 .../app/acp_handler/session_notification.rs   |  9 +++--
 .../xai-grok-shell/src/agent/config.rs        | 12 +++++++
 .../xai-grok-shell/src/agent/config_tests.rs  | 30 +++++++++++++++++
 .../session/acp_session_impl/sampler_turn.rs  | 33 ++++++++++++++-----
 4 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/src/app/acp_handler/session_notification.rs b/crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/src/app/acp_handler/session_notification.rs
